			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			In concr., <i>a condiment, spice</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 33, 6,
				9</span></i> pr.</div>
